    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 26.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="26.1" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">And sitte ælc XII monað wereleas; ⁊ ceose siððan þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> heo silf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="26.1" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ sitte ælc XII monað werleas; ceose syþþan þæt heo sylf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And sitte ælc XII monað werleas; ceose syþþan þæt heo sylf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And each of them shall remain without a husband for a year, after which she may decide as she herself desires.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And each of them is to remain husbandless for twelve months; then she may choose as she pleases.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und sitze jede ein Jahr lang gattenlos; wähle sie hernach, was sie selbst will.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let each remain without a husband for twelve months; afterwards let her choose what she herself wishes.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="255"><ref target="clause:VAtr_21-1">V Atr 21.1</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 21, 1</note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:IICn_73">II Cn 73</ref>; <ref target="clause:Rect_1">Rect 1</ref></note>
      </div>
